OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry and settled to start the
OL,6,Fnew week with light winds. Bright or
OL,7,Fsunny spells emerging at times, though
OL,8,Fperiods of cloud also widely
OL,9,Fdeveloping throughout the day. Feeling
OL,10,Fwarm where the sunshine breaks through.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FSome late brightness to end
OL,13,FMonday, then clear spells and variable
OL,14,Fcloud overnight. Staying dry
OL,15,Fthroughout. Rather warm in urban areas
OL,16,Fbut fresher in rural locations.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
