OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FAnother fine and dry day with
OL,6,Fplenty of strong sunshine emerging
OL,7,Facross the region, particularly into
OL,8,Fthe afternoon. Slightly breezier than
OL,9,FMonday but temperatures climbing
OL,10,Fhigher.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FHeat
OL,13,Fpeaking on Wednesday and Thursday with
OL,14,Ffurther strong sunshine. Cloud and
OL,15,Fpatchy outbreaks of rain then
OL,16,Ferratically arriving to end the week,
OL,17,Fmainly affecting northern counties.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
